The prose checker in scripts/ adapts work from the following project.

1. SlopMonster (https://github.com/ItsssssJack/SlopMonster)
   Copyright (c) 2026 Jack Roberts. MIT License.
   Adapted in skills/content-review/scripts/: root matching of word inflections,
   the split between warning words and failing phrases, and the sentence-window
   approach used by the prose checker. The word lists and rules here have been
   rewritten and extended.

